Synthetic market-data frames and tickers (decision 0009). Nothing in this directory was
received from Hibachi.

- Every frame is a copy of one in fixtures/hibachi/md/, hand-built in the shapes Hibachi
  publishes for its anonymous /ws/market WebSocket; that directory's README.md cites the source
  of each shape and its SYNTHETIC file where the values come from.
- Every price, size, bound and timestamp is a made-up value; the tickers are made-up Java-era
  forms of fixtures/hibachi/rest/exchange_info.json's contracts.
- None is a frame of the owner's capture of the public feed, and no count, rate or timing
  measured on it is here.
- No file holds an account id, an address, a key or a credential.

This marker covers fixtures/hibachi/conformance/ only. Recorded Hibachi frames never go here.
